        <item>
            <title>3.16.3</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:04:35 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>190</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.16.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- Slack threads can now be connected on more than one Mac at a time. Each Mac answers the threads bound to its own sessions; before, turning the Slack bridge on for a second Mac disconnected the first.

### Bug Fixes
- Connecting or disconnecting a Slack thread that fails now shows an alert, instead of failing silently.
]]></description>
